WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
Raj: The access bottleneck came from missing shutdown permission.

2
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.592
Hannah: Not hesitation? What do the audit records show?

3
00:00:08.592 --> 00:00:13.367
Raj: Two denied requests. The escalation path then worked.

4
00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:16.991
Lukas: Who was the decision owner for emergency access?

5
00:00:16.991 --> 00:00:21.695
Anika: The infrastructure duty manager, not our primary on-call.

6
00:00:21.695 --> 00:00:25.943
Priya: Just to confirm, preapproved scoped access, right?

7
00:00:25.943 --> 00:00:30.911
Hannah: Maybe, with expiry and auditable two-person approval.

8
00:00:30.911 --> 00:00:34.438
Raj: We'll page the backup if access checks fail.

9
00:00:34.438 --> 00:00:39.166
Lukas: Okay, test permissions without touching production power controls.

10
00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:43.510
Priya: Agreed. Make that a preflight check next time.

